<title>GERMANY: Raab Karcher completes buy of Wyle.</title>
<headline>Raab Karcher completes buy of Wyle.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veba AG unit Raab Karcher said on Wednesday it had completed its purchase of U.S. electronics dealer Wyle.</p>
<p>Raab Karcher said its unit EBV Electronics Inc had been offered 96.2 percent of Wyle's shares, and that Raab Karcher had approved the purchase.  </p>
<p>EBV Electronics had bid $50 a share, and will offer the same amount to remaining shareholders.</p>
<p>Wyle and Raab Karcher had earlier put the purchase price at $632 million. Including Wyle's debt, the transaction has a value of about $810 million.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
